Subject: [EXPERIMENT] ASoC: AudioReach: use the FullIO PCM/MFC media prelude

Use the two pinned module destinations instead of walking every module
with playback format. Require the existing PA-off and transport checks.
Use module-directed token-matched SET_CFG for single frames. Render stays off.

